## TLS on prod

Nginx mounts `certbot/conf/live` + `certbot/conf/archive` (Certbot symlinks) from the **server filesystem**.

| Domain | Renewal on VPS |
|--------|----------------|
| sexappeal.drsrv.net.ar | Certbot (`scripts/certbot/issue-domain.sh`) |
| selfappeal.drsrv.net.ar | Certbot (`scripts/certbot/issue-selfappeal.sh`) |

**Timer:** `scripts/certbot/install-systemd.sh` — renew check **once per day** (~04:15 UTC), not twice.

**Rebrand:** outreach alias is **selfappeal.drsrv.net.ar** (replaced **fcwa.drsrv.net.ar**). Same app as sexappeal; used for WhatsApp step-2 links only.

**Google SEO:** only **sexappeal.drsrv.net.ar** goes in Search Console (`/sitemap.xml`). SelfAppeal is noindex — do not submit to Google.

`certbot/` is excluded from the deploy tarball — certs live only on the VPS after initial `certbot certonly`.
